Guys this repo will cover my progress of learning rust
but reason this is a public repo is that I also wanna encourage you to learn as well.

whoever following this is advised to visit
https://doc.rust-lang.org/stable/rust-by-example/index.html

this docs will help you learn intricacies of the language
but will not help with connecting the dots that well
So, I made this repo to hopefully make it easier for anyone new

Anyway here are the steps to contribute to my repo
Incase you want to make some correction if you think as a begineer
some specific things should be added or changed


1> pull request to edit as you like.
2> write your own version and send it in for review.
3> once reviewed and approved i will merge it to main for someone else to do the same.
